{"speciesId":614,"names":{"fr":"Polagriffe","es":"Beartic","en":"Beartic","ja":"ツンベアー"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il fait lui-même geler son haleine. Il est bon nageur et sillonne les mers du nord à la recherche de ses proies."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It can make its breath freeze at will. Very able in the water, it swims around in northern seas and catches prey."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il gèle son haleine et en fait des crocs et des griffes de glace pour combattre. Il vit dans les terres gelées du nord."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It freezes its breath to create fangs and claws of ice to fight with. Cold northern areas are its habitat."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"They love the cold seas of the north. They create pathways across the ocean waters by freezing their own breath."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"They love the cold seas of the north. They create pathways across the ocean waters by freezing their own breath."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il aime les mers glaciales du nord. Il y trace son chemin en créant des îlots de glace pour éviter de nager."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Adoran los mares gélidos del norte. Congelan su aliento para crear sendas por las que caminar sobre las aguas."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"They love the cold seas of the north. They create pathways across the ocean waters by freezing their own breath."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"北の 冷たい 海を 好む。 口から 吐きだした 息を凍らせ 海の上に 道をつくり 歩く。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il gèle son haleine et en fait des crocs et des griffes de glace pour combattre. Il vit dans les terres gelées du nord."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Congela su aliento y crea colmillos y garras de hielo para combatir. Vive en las gélidas tierras del norte."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It freezes its breath to create fangs and claws of ice to fight with. Cold northern areas are its habitat."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"吐く 息を 凍らせて 氷の キバや ツメを 作り 戦う。 北の 寒い 土地で 暮らす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il aime les mers glaciales du nord. Il y trace son chemin en créant des îlots de glace pour éviter de nager."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Adoran los mares gélidos del norte. Congelan su aliento para crear sendas por las que caminar sobre las aguas."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"They love the cold seas of the north. They create pathways across the ocean waters by freezing their own breath."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"北の 冷たい 海を 好む。 口から 吐きだした 息を凍らせ 海の上に 道をつくり 歩く。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il gèle son haleine et en fait des crocs et des griffes de glace pour combattre. Il vit dans les terres gelées du nord."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Congela su aliento y crea colmillos y garras de hielo para combatir. Vive en las gélidas tierras del norte."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"It freezes its breath to create fangs and claws of ice to fight with. Cold northern areas are its habitat."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"吐く 息を 凍らせて 氷の キバや ツメを 作り 戦う。 北の 寒い 土地で 暮らす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Les crocs qu’il façonne en gelant son souffle sont plus durs que l’acier. Il sillonne les eaux des mers glaciales à la recherche de nourriture."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Congela su aliento y crea colmillos de hielo más duros que el acero. Nada en mares de aguas frías en busca de alimento."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It swims through frigid seas, searching for prey. From its frozen breath, it forms icy fangs that are harder than steel."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"吐息を 凍らせ つくった キバは 鋼より 硬い。 寒い 海を エサを 探して 泳ぎまわる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il sillonne les mers glaciale